<title>UK: Banco Real details two-tranche dollar bond.</title>
<headline>Banco Real details two-tranche dollar bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following two-tranche bond</p>
<p>was announced by lead manager WestMerchant.</p>
<p>BORROWER   BANCO REAL.</p>
<p>TRANCHE A</p>
<p> AMT    $175 MLN	COUPON     7.875     MATURITY    18.JUL.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.8557   PAY DATE    18.JUL.97</p>
<p> SPREAD     +190 BP   REOFFER    99.8557   REOFF YTM   7.93 PCT</p>
<p> NOTES	OVER THREE-YEAR U.S.T</p>
<p>* * * *</p>
<p>TRANCHE B</p>
<p> AMT    $75 MLN	 COUPON     8.125     MATURITY    18.JUL.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.8490   PAY DATE    18.JUL.97</p>
<p> SPREAD     +205 BP   REOFFER    99.8490   REOFF YTM   8.17 PCT</p>
<p> NOTES	OVER FOUR-YEAR U.S.T</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS US/UK/BR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   MGT/UND    25 BP     SELL CONC   25 BP</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
